Banking Supervision
The Basel Framework
The Basel Framework is the full set of
standards of the Basel Committee on Banking
Supervision (BCBS), which is the primary global
standard setter for the prudential regulation of
banks. The membership of the BCBS has
agreed to fully implement these standards and
apply them to the internationally active banks
in their jurisdictions.
This document has been generated on 17/10/2026 based on the Basel Framework data
available on the BIS website (www.bis.org).
