60.70
The computation of the sensitivities-based method for Group 2a cryptoassets includes new
specifications of delta, vega and curvature risk factors. The sensitivity definitions are also
extended to include that of Group 2a cryptoassets. Finally, a new bucket structure is
introduced, composed of multiple buckets, one for each Group 2a cryptoasset, containing only
its respective sensitivities.
60.71
