FAQ1
Does the Committee have any further guidance on the definition of SPVs? Are SPVs
referred to in CAP10.26 those which are consolidated under international financial
reporting standards (IFRS) or all SPVs?
Guidance should be sought from national supervisors. SPVs referred to in CAP10.26
refer to all SPVs irrespective of whether they are consolidated under IFRS or other
applicable accounting standards.
