referred to as “other TLAC liabilities”:
All direct, indirect and synthetic investments in the instruments of a G-SIB resolution
1.
entity that are eligible to be recognised as external TLAC but that do not otherwise
qualify as regulatory capital
54 for the issuing G-SIB, with the exception of instruments
excluded by CAP30.4; and
All holdings of instruments issued by a G-SIB resolution entity that rank pari passu to any
2.
instruments included in CAP30.3(1), with the exceptions of:
instruments listed as liabilities excluded from TLAC in Section 10 of the FSB TLAC
1.
Term Sheet (“Excluded Liabilities”); and
instruments ranking pari passu with instruments eligible to be recognised as TLAC
2.
by virtue of the exemptions to the subordination requirements in Section 11 of the
FSB TLAC Term Sheet.
