equity (after the application of all regulatory adjustments set out in CAP30.7 to CAP30.30):
significant investments in the common shares of unconsolidated financial institutions
1.
(banks, insurance and other financial entities) as referred to in CAP30.29;
mortgage servicing rights; and
2.
