transitional period. This means that such DTA amount must not be considered for
Common Equity Tier 1 capital, and in return must not be subject to deduction from
Common Equity Tier 1 capital and must not be subject to risk weighting, as applicable.
An accounting provision amount not deducted from Common Equity Tier 1 capital should
3.
