Frequency of calculation of the countercyclical buﬀer requirements
30.19
Banks must ensure that their countercyclical buﬀer requirements are calculated and publically
disclosed with at least the same frequency as their minimum capital requirements. The buﬀer
should be based on the latest relevant jurisdictional countercyclical buﬀers that are available at
the date that they calculate their minimum capital requirement.
