Standardised Credit Risk Assessment Approach (SCRA): This approach is for all exposures
2.
of banks incorporated in jurisdictions that do not allow the use of external ratings for
regulatory purposes. For exposures to banks that are unrated, this approach also applies
to banks incorporated in jurisdictions that allow the use of external ratings for regulatory
purposes.
