Sovereign entities,
143 PSEs, multilateral development banks (MDBs), banks, securities
1.
firms and other prudentially regulated financial institutions with a lower risk weight than
the counterparty;
144
In jurisdictions that allow the use of external ratings for regulatory purposes:
2.
other entities that are externally rated except when credit protection is provided to
1.
