better at the time the credit protection was provided. This would include credit
protection provided by parent, subsidiary and aﬃliate companies when they have a
lower risk weight than the obligor.
In jurisdictions that do not allow the use of external ratings for regulatory purposes:
3.
Other entities, defined as “investment grade” meaning they have adequate
1.
