(ii)
The creditworthiness of these “investment grade entities” is not positively
correlated with the credit risk of the exposures for which they provided guarantees.
Parent, subsidiary and aﬃliate companies of the obligor where their
2.
creditworthiness is not positively correlated with the credit risk of the exposures for
which they provided guarantees. For an intra-group company to be recognised as
eligible guarantor, the credit risk of the whole group should be taken into account.
2 Footnotes
