Given the data limitations associated with SL exposures, a bank may remain on the supervisory
slotting criteria approach for one or more of the PF, OF, CF, IPRE or HVCRE sub-classes, and
move to the foundation or advanced approach for the other sub-classes. However, a bank
should not move to the advanced approach for the HVCRE sub-class without also doing so for
material IPRE exposures at the same time.
