same parameter must be used consistently for all interest rate options in the same
currency. For each jurisdiction, and for each aﬀected currency j, the supervisor is
encouraged to make a recommendation to banks for an appropriate value of λj,
with the objective to set it as low as possible. Banks are permitted to use lower
