Securitisation Standardised Approach (SEC-SA) set out in CRE41 if the SEC-ERBA has not
been implemented by the national regulator or the bank is not able to use the SEC-ERBA;
or a 1250% risk weight where the specified requirements for using the SEC-ERBA or SEC-
