approach to credit risk. Each set of risk weights for unexpected loss (UL) was produced using
the appropriate risk-weight function of the risk-weight functions set out in CRE31. The inputs
used to calculate the illustrative risk weights include measures of the probability of default
(PD), loss-given-default (LGD), and an assumed eﬀective maturity (M) of 2.5 years, where
