The total capital requirement under the sensitivities-based method is aggregated as follows:
For each of three correlation scenarios, the bank must simply sum up the separately
1.
calculated delta, vega and curvature capital requirements for all risk classes to
determine the overall capital requirement for that scenario.
The sensitivities-based method capital requirement is the largest capital requirement
2.
from the three scenarios.
For the calculation of capital requirements for all instruments in all trading desks
1.
