MAR33.40, the capital requirement is calculated for all instruments in all trading
desks.
For the calculation of capital requirements for each trading desk using the
2.
standardised approach as if that desk were a standalone regulatory portfolio as set
out in MAR11.8(2), the capital requirements under each correlation scenario are
calculated and compared at each trading desk level, and the maximum for each
trading desk is taken as the capital requirement.
