The commodity vega risk factors are further defined along one dimension, the maturity of
the option. This is defined as the implied volatility of the option as mapped to one or
several of the following maturity tenors: 0.5 years, 1 year, 3 years, 5 years and 10 years.
Curvature commodity: the commodity curvature risk factors are defined along only one
3.
dimension, the constructed curve (ie no term structure decomposition) per commodity
