designed to reflect the price sensitivity of those positions to assumed changes in interest rates.
The weights for each time band are set out in Table 4. Zero-coupon bonds and deep-discount
bonds (defined as bonds with a coupon of less than 3%) should be slotted according to the time
bands set out in the second column of Table 4.
