spread risk is driven by a single factor. Under this assumption, ρ can be
interpreted as the correlation between the credit spread of a counterparty and
the single credit spread systematic factor.","Basel Framework, MAR50, num. 50.13-50.14, pp. 725-726","pymupdf+bookmark_title_match+numeral_split","0.99","false",""
