The first term
aggregates the systematic components of
1.
CVA risk arising from the bank’s counterparties, the single-name hedges and the index
hedges.
The second term
aggregates the idiosyncratic components
2.
of CVA risk arising from the bank’s counterparties and the single-name hedges.
The third term
aggregates the components of indirect hedges that are not
3.
aligned with counterparties’ credit spreads.","Basel Framework, MAR50, num. 50.21-50.22, pp. 728-729","pymupdf+bookmark_title_match+numeral_split","0.99","false",""
