The interest rate vega risk factors for all currencies:
The interest rate vega risk factors are a simultaneous relative change of all volatilities for
1.
the inflation rate and a simultaneous relative change of all interest rate volatilities for a
given currency.
The sensitivity to (i) the interest rate volatilities or (ii) inflation rate volatilities is
2.
