claim to receive or obligation to pay only the net sum of the positive and negative mark-
to-market values of included individual transactions in the event that a counterparty fails
to perform due to any of the following: default, bankruptcy, liquidation or similar
circumstances;
written and reasoned legal opinions that, in the event of a legal challenge, the relevant
2.
