30.40
Level 1 assets can comprise an unlimited share of the pool and are not subject to a haircut
under the LCR.
405 However, national supervisors may wish to require haircuts for Level 1
securities based on, among other things, their sensitivity to interest rate and market risk, credit
and liquidity risk, and typical repo haircuts.
