liquidity needs arising from its operations in that local jurisdiction. This also
applies to Level 2B assets.
FAQ1
While corporate debt securities with a rating between A+ and BBB– whose
maximum decline of price does not exceed 20% may be included in Level 2B
according to LCR30.45(2), and corporate debt securities with a rating of at least
