This could reflect a case where a bank may imply that it would be subject to
funding risk if it did not exercise an option on its own funding.","Basel Framework, NSF30, num. 30.4-30.7, pp. 914-915","pymupdf+bookmark_title_match+numeral_split","0.99","false",""
