The following examples illustrate the scenarios in SRP31.91(2) and SRP31.91(4).
Short rate shock: Assume that the bank uses the standardised framework with K = 19
1.
time bands and with tK = 25 years (the midpoint (in time) of the longest tenor bucket K),
