Additional intraday monitoring tools applicable to reporting banks that provide
correspondent banking services
Value of payments made on behalf of correspondent banking customers
50.76
The value of payments made on behalf of correspondent banking customers
572 tool will enable
supervisors to gain a better understanding of the proportion of a correspondent bank’s
payment flows that arise from its provision of correspondent banking services. These flows may
have a significant impact on the correspondent bank’s own intraday liquidity management.
573
2 Footnotes
572
The term ”customers” includes all entities for which the correspondent bank
provides correspondent banking services.
573
