TLAC before adjustments. To be calculated as: row 11 + row 17.
19
Deductions of exposures between MPE G-SIB resolution groups that correspond
to items eligible for TLAC (not applicable for SPE G-SIBs). All amounts reported in
this row should correspond to deductions applied after the appropriate
adjustments agreed by the crisis management group (CMG) (following the
penultimate paragraph of Section 3 of the TLAC Term Sheet, the CMG shall
discuss and, where appropriate and consistent with the resolution strategy,
agree on the allocation of the deduction). National authorities may include in
this row an MPE G-SIB resolution entity's investments in other resolution groups
(see Note).
