TLAC of the resolution group (as the case may be) after deductions. To be
calculated as: row 18 - row 19 - row 20 - row 21.
23
Total RWA of the resolution group under the TLAC regime. For SPE G-SIBs, this
information is based on the consolidated figure, so the amount reported in this
row will coincide with that in row 60 of Template CC1.
24
Leverage exposure measure of the resolution group (denominator of leverage
ratio).
25
TLAC ratio (as a percentage of RWA for TLAC purposes), to be calculated as row
