Introduction
35.1
The disclosure requirements under this section are:
Table REMA – Remuneration policy
1.
Template REM1 – Remuneration awarded during financial year
2.
Template REM2 – Special payments
3.
Template REM3 – Deferred remuneration
4.
35.2
Table REMA provides information on a bank’s remuneration policy as well as key features of
the remuneration system.
35.3
Templates REM1, REM2 and REM3 provide information on a bank’s fixed and variable
remuneration awarded during the financial year, details of any special payments made, and
information on a bank’s total outstanding deferred and retained remuneration, respectively.","Basel Framework, DIS35, num. 35.1-35.3, pp. 1210-1211","pymupdf+bookmark_title_match+numeral_split+page_split","0.99","false",""
