Sovereign exposures
This chapter describes disclosure requirements
for sovereign exposures.
Version eﬀective as of 01
January 2023
First version in the consolidated Basel
Framework.
Introduction
45.1
This chapter sets out disclosure requirements for sovereign exposures. Implementation of the
templates set out in this chapter is only mandatory when required by national supervisors at a
jurisdictional level.
45.2
The definitions used throughout the templates are consistent with CRE20, MAR22 and MAR40.","Basel Framework, DIS45, num. 45.1-45.2, pp. 1262-1263","pymupdf+bookmark_title_match+numeral_split+page_split","0.99","false",""
"c_62d4af147c9539f5","int-bcbs-basel-framework-2026","Basel Framework","Basel III - Basel Framework consolidado","BCBS/BIS","INT","international_standard","in_force","","2026-01-01","","https://www.bis.org/committees/bcbs/basel-framework/basel-framework.pdf","fuentes_descargadas/02_normativa_internacional/18_bis_basel_framework_2026.pdf","acf3759fc231fb8f13131e50b12ad11e18bc9ebe53f105595fd8e16609a3547f","int-bcbs-basel-framework-2026#nsec-45-occ2","45","numbered_section","DIS Disclosure requirements > 45 Sovereign exposures > num. 45.3","1263","1264","45.3
The disclosure requirements under this section are:
Template SOV1: Exposures to sovereign entities – country
1.
Template SOV2: Exposures to sovereign entities – currency denomination breakdown
2.
