Principle 13 - Home-host relationships
40.30
Principle 13:
641 Home and host supervisors of cross-border banking groups share information
and cooperate for eﬀective supervision of the group and group entities, and eﬀective handling
of crisis situations. Supervisors require the local operations of foreign banks to be conducted to
the same standards as those required of domestic banks.
