The third section should provide an overview of the supervisory environment for the financial
sector, with a brief description of the institutional and legal setting, in particular the mandate
and oversight roles of the diﬀerent supervisory authorities, the existence of unregulated
financial intermediaries and the role of self-regulatory organisations. Furthermore, it should
provide a general description of the structure of the financial markets and, in particular, the
